    {
        "id": "adac8cfec9215b68",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "629fa02299718c62",
        "g": "b77b258ce6d4177c",
        "name": "config flow",
        "info": "# Configuration Flow\nConfiguration flow for settings and debugging of entered config.\n\n---\n\n## Information Input\nThe following information set needs to be set as flow variables to be available within the complete workflow:\n\n**Get Variable Configuration:**\n1. `datatronName`: String that defines the `datatronName` for the variable query (shall contain one datatron name)\n3. `plcName`: String that defines the `plcName` (if multiple plcs of one edge device necessary, please enter a string that matches all `plcNames`)\n4. `alertVariableName`: String that can be used to query the available tag list per datatron\n5. `url`: String that defines base url to query the necessary variables (e.g. http://<datatron-api-host>/api/datatrons) [hint: see swagger documentation if necessary]\n6. `headers`: JSON that defines the necessary headers, in this case the Bearer Token is necessary\n8. `datapointConfig`: Array with objects where `uuid` and `label` per variable are defined (query based on `datatronName`, `plcName` and `alertVariableName`)\n\n**Set Error Message Mapping:**\n1. `alertmessageConfig`: Array with objects where `error_number` and `error_message` are defined\n\n---\n\n## Debug Flow Config\nGeneral function to get a debug notification, how the configuration flow is set up and which information set was entered there.",
        "x": 120,
        "y": 100,
        "wires": []
    },
