        "info": "# Set Error Message Mapping\n\n## Mandatory Input Variables:\n\n1. `csv mapping data`: CSV input that is defining the error message mapping within the template node labeled as \"csv data\"\n\n2. CSV Table Input Specification:\n    \n    * the CSV table shall be separated with a semicolon\n    * the CSV table shall contain two columns  \n    * the CSV table shall not contain column headers (fixed during CSV parsing)  \n    * the CSV table shall contain one mapping per row  \n    * the CSV table shall be submitted as `plain text`  \n    * the CSV table shall be submitted on `msg.payload`\n\n!!! warning\n    - Attention, if the schema of the csv file is different, the input can not be parsed and the configuration will not be available",
